        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha mfalume walagiza, na achikusanya vilongozi osi a Juda na a Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha ye mfalume waambuka kuphiya nyumbani mwa Mwenyezi Mlungu phamwenga na atu osi a Juda na enyezi a Jerusalemu, alavyadzi-sadaka, Alawi na atu osi avyere kpwa adide. Achiasomera maneno gosi ga cho chitabu cha chilagane chophahikana ndani ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
